  "note": "Official China MIUI 12.5.1 fastboot package for polaris. Extract with gpu-driver/tools/ext4_extract.py (sparse ext4, read-only, no mount). a630_zap.mdt embeds the SHA-256 of b00 (offset 188) and b02 (offset 252), so the four zap files are provably one signed bundle. a630_sqe.fw here is 31980 bytes (version 0x016ee187) while the handset this port was measured on reports 32136, hence the manifest pins the size instead of the 32136 baseline."
